1. Dangerous materials or substances such as poisons, acids, caustics and explosives;
2. Yard rubbish except as hereinafter provided;
3. Automobile and motor vehicle tires;
4. Paint; and
5. All other solid waste not specifically authorized in this chapter.
(Ord. 96-11.11.B (part))
